Nefertiti's Sceptre was sealed deep within the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] and protected by a series of deadly traps and riddles thought out by Nefertiti herself. It was eventually acquired by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. However, in order to escape [[the Organization]] forces, [[Dante Vale]] threw the sceptre into a waterfall to allow the team time to escape and it was recovered by Klaus' [[Suits]]. However Dante then revealed he had placed a tracking device on the sceptre which would lead them to [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}

Klaus later destroyed Nefertiti's sceptre after scanning it and recovering [[Neverlost]]. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}
